WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand with feet wider than hips, toes out.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the knees into a squat; place a block under the heels or hips if needed.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press the elbows into the knees and lift the chest.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hands can meet at the heart.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then sit back or stand.
